 event from a right-front three-quarter viewpoint. Position the camera approximately 70 centimeters above the ground, slightly below the subject's waist level and 35 degrees to the right of the original camera axis. Use a medium full shot that keeps the complete body and all physical interactions visible.\n\nPreserve the original character identity, face, hairstyle, body proportions, clothing, complete action sequence, motion timing, gestures, poses, expressions, gaze direction, physical contacts, movement speed, environment, lighting, props, shot duration, and synchronized audio as closely as possible.\n\nChange only the camera position, perspective, framing, and camera path. The camera performs a restrained parallel tracking movement matching the subject's original movement, maintaining a stable distance and producing natural foreground parallax. Do not alter the original action or cause the subject to turn toward the new camera.\n\nReconstruct newly visible surfaces consistently with the original person, clothing, objects, and environment. Preserve the original world-space lighting; only the visible highlights, reflections, shadows, and occlusions change naturally because of the new viewpoint. The result should look like the same original event was filmed simultaneously by a second camera from the specified angle.\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":127,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[-1490,4940],"size":[640,90],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"UNet名称","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"数据类型","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","links":[299]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.29.2","Node name for S&R":"UNETLoader","models":[{"name":"minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors","url":"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusi